# Agent worktrees (Claude Code's under .claude, Delta's under .delta) are checkouts of this same
# repo, so `//...` would otherwise expand into every one.
.claude
.delta

# SwiftPM build directories can contain BUILD files, which Bazel would otherwise try to load.
.build
.swiftpm
swift/.build
swift/.swiftpm

# The convenience symlinks (bazel-*) are ignored by glob in REPO.bazel.

# The benchmark package's SwiftPM build. Bazel loads only Benchmarks/BUILD.bazel, which caches
# the simulated counts (tools/benchmarks.bzl).
Benchmarks/.build
Benchmarks/.swiftpm

# The fuzz package builds with SwiftPM.
Fuzz/.build

# The differential package's SwiftPM build (`just diff --swiftpm`).
Differential/.build

# The browser explorer is a SwiftPM package; its build directory can contain BUILD files.
Explore

# Test catalogs (Tests/Catalogs/README.md): Python and generator inputs, never built.
Tests/Catalogs
